description = "TGPulse-Next Model 1 single system build with Vulkan/OpenGL compute rendering, software fallback and native audio. Compiles only Model 1 machine components and required shared devices."
notes = "Complete Model 1 ZIPs use game-specific racing, VF, Wing War, SWA Pilot/Gunner or experimental NetMerc controls. Frontend Save RAM and Save States use the existing Model 1 NVRAM and machine-state APIs. Linked cabinets use frontend Netpacket for supported sets; Save States are unavailable while COMM is fitted. Model 2 machine components and catalogue entries are excluded at build time. Physical controller/gameplay validation remains user-run."
